WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Alice gives Bob a book. Giver, recipient and object are distinct roles in one event.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
Carol remembers that giving event. The event is now the content of a memory.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
Dave believes Carol remembers it. His belief does not itself establish the memory as fact.
